 "LIMITATION_model_lineage": "The two scans are independent in PHYSICS (energy, reconstruction, flattening). The two ink MAPS are both ScrollPrize model output and we cannot verify from the public bucket whether the recipes share architecture, training data or lineage. If they do, part of the measured agreement is shared MODEL bias, not shared ink. Accurate description: cross-energy and cross-recipe, NOT fully independent. The physics half of the independence is verified; the model half is not.",
